      "points": 74,
      "num_comments": 22,
      "snippet": "Hi HN, Jonathan &amp; Guy here from OneCLI, an agent harness built for teams, giving every employee a secured, sandboxed personal agent.<p>Here’s what you can do with it:<p>1. get a sandboxed agent, with all the OneCLI capabilities in place like connect your GitHub account, Gmail, Notion, or Dropbox simply from the chat.<p>2. deterministic human in the loop approval in the chat itself for things that you need 100% control like sending an email or deleting the Linear ticket.<p>3. manage team policy in one place, enforced across every agent in the workspace<p>4. enjoy global connections at the team level, like shared LLM keys or service accounts<p>Here’s a demo: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=dlW-44ntpbE\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=dlW-44ntpbE</a><p>We started working on this by accident, even though our careers were in the securi",
